url: "https://github.com/Devanik21/The-Invention-Archive/tree/main/Theoretical%20Research/Pulse_Resolved_Identifiability_An_Adaptive_Design_Principle_for_Separating_Drift_and_Diffusion_in_Destructive_Single_Cell_Assays"
repository-code: "https://github.com/Devanik21/The-Invention-Archive"
abstract: >-
  A reproducible mathematical benchmark for identifying relaxation, input gain,
  and diffusion intensity from controlled pulse responses observed through
  destructive single-cell snapshots. The results are synthetic and do not
  constitute empirical biological validation.
keywords:
  - single-cell perturbation
  - structural identifiability
  - stochastic differential equations
  - Fisher information
  - optimal experimental design
